VC-FC-06: VoucherRequests::forget_reference() for the Form Captain adapter (contract: ADAPTERS.md 7.1).

Against branch claude/wp-plugin-analyse-todo-hvollo-refactors at c216dd1. Apply there with:
  git apply docs/patches/voucher-requests-forget-reference.patch
(copy the file over from claude/sleepy-ptolemy-n32guj first). Adds forget_reference( string $reference ):
bool|WP_Error without a capability check, deletes an open request or anonymises an issued one (vouchers stay),
sets the reference claim to "rejected:<UTC>" and fires vcap_voucher_request_forgotten( $request_id, $result ).

